From 2be507771894098b52b7339bd8bbfb0deb43185b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Craterbrain <58347640+Craterbrain@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 09:57:35 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 01/15] Slim Recents: import from AICP
 frameworks_opt_slimrecent

Verbatim snapshot of https://github.com/AICP/frameworks_opt_slimrecent
branch w16.2 (3cd22322fd7ebd48d6ed7c62a81d7574d7511653), the Android 16
version of Slim Recents, into slimrecent/. Not built yet; the next
commits hook it into Quickstep and adapt it.

Slim Recents started in SlimRoms (Lars Greiss), was rewritten for ABC
rom and Dirty Unicorns (ezio84, Griffin Millender, Alex Cruz,
SpiritCroc and others) and has been kept up to date in AICP by
SpiritCroc. Authors in its history: SpiritCroc, ezio84 (Ezio Lacandia
Bijelkic), Carlos Solano, Griffin Millender, Varun Date, Thecrazyskull,
maxwen, Lars Greiss, Danesh Mondegarian, Ali B, Alex Cruz, and the AICP
translators (Ralf Luther, wartomato, doc HD). Copyright headers are
kept as in the source (SlimRoms Project, ABC rom, Android Ice Cold
Project, The CyanogenMod Project, The Android Open Source Project).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
